text:
lee-sales: Quick ask 1: Beacon Retail wants a 10-day POC next week. Scope: streaming receipts -> structured JSON + function call to enrich SKUs. They asked for a tiny drop-in SDK example and a hosted vs dedicated ballpark for ~28k tokens/day. Any immediate blockers?

ana-presales: Hosted POC is fine. Recommend low-latency mode (batching off) and a compact model. I'll prepare a minimal node + py snippet.

tom-se: Node sample (very short):
```js
import Redwood from '@redwood/inference';
const c = new Redwood({ apiKey: process.env.RW_KEY });
for await (const ev of c.chat.stream({ model:'redwood-lite-1', messages:[{role:'user',content:'Extract receipt -> json'}], functions:[{name:'enrich_sku'}] })){
  if (ev.type==='delta') process.stdout.write(ev.delta);
  if (ev.type==='function_call') fetch(process.env.WEBHOOK,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(ev.payload)});
}
```

harper-sec: Security: Beacon needs SOC2 + IP allowlist + SSO for prod. For the POC enable scoped API keys with short TTL and IP allowlist. For prod recommend Dedicated or Private with customer KMS and full audit logs. I'll attach a short checklist to the invite.

infra-bot: infra-bot: RDW-6600 opened to reserve a low-latency hosted test slot. ETA ~36h.

lee-sales: Pricing quick math: 28k/day ~ 840k/mo. Hosted list ~ $0.00029/token -> ~$244/mo. Dedicated baseline for consistent <250ms SLOs starts ~ $2k/mo; will confirm exact quote.

ana-presales: Action items: 1) push mini SDK repo link, 2) webhook example for function outputs, 3) exact hosted vs dedicated numbers.

lee-sales: Can we schedule kickoff Fri 9am PT? I'll include pre-call checklist.

harper-sec: Fri 9am PT works. I'll prepare IP allowlist steps and a redacted audit log sample.

lee-sales: Invite sent. Ping here if blockers before Fri. :thumbsup:
